OL,3,GNEWSABBC Nations boss champions Welsh
OL,4,Alanguage amid 'serious' cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC's new Director of Nations says
OL,7,Fshe has "never seen such a serious
OL,8,Fsituation for the corporation" as the
OL,9,FBBC commits to swathes of job cuts and
OL,10,Faxes programming across the UK in a bid
OL,11,Fto save #500m.
OL,13,FThis week it was confirmed Rhuanedd
OL,14,FRichards, who is from the Cynon Valley,
OL,15,Fwould head BBC operations across the
OL,16,Fdevolved nations and the English
OL,17,Fregions following a temporary stint in
OL,18,Fthe post.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
