OL,3,GNEWSABBC Nations boss champions Welsh
OL,4,Alanguage amid 'serious' cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn September BBC Wales announced 58 job
OL,7,Fcuts, as well as a 20-hour annual cut
OL,8,Fin TV programming, leading the First
OL,9,FMinister to warn the BBC could fall
OL,10,Ffoul of its public service obligations.
OL,12,FRichards vowed to fight for the Welsh
OL,13,Flanguage and its presence at the BBC
OL,14,F"while there is breath in my body".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
